perturbplan
-----------

`src/pysceptre/analytical_power/` is a port of the post-hoc power path of
PerturbPlan: `compute_power_posthoc`, `compute_distribution_teststat`,
`compute_zero_prob`, `compute_QC` and `rejection_computation`.

